WEBVTT

00:51:57.483 --> 00:52:00.249
It is that relationships
are the key to restoring society

00:52:00.273 --> 00:52:01.857
but relationships don't scale,

00:52:01.881 --> 00:52:04.375
because they're built
one-on-one and they take time.

00:52:04.399 --> 00:52:06.002
But norms scale.

00:52:06.026 --> 00:52:09.652
If you can shift the norms of a culture,
how we should behave in the world,

00:52:09.676 --> 00:52:11.648
then you can really have a bigger change.

00:52:11.672 --> 00:52:15.200
These weavers are a movement
that doesn't know it's a movement.

00:52:15.224 --> 00:52:16.394
They're all out there.

00:52:16.418 --> 00:52:18.149
They don't know their common values.

00:52:18.173 --> 00:52:20.554
They don't know they're all
part of one big thing.

00:52:20.578 --> 00:52:23.888
And we just try to lift them up and say,
"You actually are one thing,"

00:52:23.912 --> 00:52:25.880
And if we can unify and create some hubs,

00:52:25.904 --> 00:52:27.343
then we can have a big effect.

00:52:27.367 --> 00:52:30.368
CA: I mean, is there any political policy